`packages/kiro-core` is a port of that project's Kiro protocol layer — endpoint
resolution, the model catalog and its cache, kiro-cli credential reuse and token
refresh, AWS event-stream parsing, thinking and tool-call parsing, history
validation and repair, and retry classification. The port replaces the pi-ai
message and event types with a host-neutral vocabulary so the same protocol code
can serve both OMP and the DeepSeek Harness; the protocol behaviour itself is
upstream's.
